    note right of hello
        Retire only for another build.
        Send only to the same build.
    end note
    note right of sent
        INV AtMostOnce. A resend keeps
        the intent id. A written frame
        stays in the service's buffer.
    end note
    note right of inspect
        Without a service only while
        no process holds service.lock.
        INV ReportHonest
    end note
